Helicopter oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Lets the helicopter probes run Skyrider's code headless: with gOracleSkyriderSilent set, SkyriderDialogue records the
quote number in gOracleSkyriderQuotes instead of queueing dialogue, a monologue's special events run at once instead of
from the dialogue queue, and RequestGiveSkyriderNewDestination skips its message box and cursor change. Appends wrappers
around the static MakeHeliReturnToBase, RequestGiveSkyriderNewDestination and HandleNewDestConfirmation
(the latter with fPlotForHelicopter set). No behaviour change while the flag is clear. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh
after 0013.

